    "home_faq_xK3HGp": {
      "type": "home-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_qyG8py": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Floor coverage and fit</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– Will the mats definitely fit?</strong><br/>Yes. Our EVA mats are designed specifically for every brand, model and version of a car and cover the whole floor area, including the places rubber and velour mats leave unprotected.</p><p><strong>– What is a tunnel mat?</strong><br/>EVA mats cover up to 98% of the floor including the centre tunnel, giving maximum protection.</p><p><strong>– Is the heel pad fitted to the driver's mat?</strong><br/>No, the heel pad is supplied separately so you can position it to your own preference.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_eNMPaU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Material properties and durability</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– What is EVA material?</strong><br/>It is a 10 mm thick foam that keeps dirt and water on the surface of the mat and stops them getting underneath.</p><p><strong>– What is the difference between the 3D set and the 3D set with edges?</strong><br/>The 3D set with edges gives additional protection to the side trim by the floor and fits even better.</p><p><strong>– How long will the mats last?</strong><br/>Thanks to the durable EVA material the mats last 5 to 7 years with no signs of wear.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_fUwAtz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Use and care</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– How do I clean EVA mats?</strong><br/>Dirt does not stick to the surface. Simply shake it out, or rinse the mat with a pressure washer when it is heavily soiled.</p><p><strong>– Are EVA mats suitable for summer and winter?</strong><br/>Yes. They are waterproof, odourless, temperature-resistant and ideal for year-round use.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_imjMCm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Ordering and delivery</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>– What is the delivery time?</strong><br/>We usually complete orders within 2 weeks. For special vehicles such as motorboats or tractors it can extend to 4–6 weeks.</p><p><strong>– How is delivery handled?</strong><br/>We ship the mats by courier straight to the customer's address. Because of the product size we do not send them to parcel lockers. We make sure the mats arrive exactly as they were made — without folding or bending, which could affect the fit.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        }
      },
